---
// Vix sponsor sidebar note.
---

<div class="sponsor-card">
  <div class="sponsor-card-header">
    <div>
      <span>Exploring</span>
      <h4><code>vic/vix</code>?</h4>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sponsor-card-body">
    <p>
      vix is a live production fleet built with <a href="https://yen.oeiuwq.com/">Yen</a> — part of <a href="https://dendritic.oeiuwq.com">@vic's Dendritic Ecosystem</a>.
    </p>
    <a class="sponsor-cta" href="https://github.com/sponsors/vic">Sponsor vic</a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .sponsor-card {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-hairline);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--sl-color-accent) 5%, var(--sl-color-bg));
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .sponsor-card h4 {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-white);
  }

  .sponsor-card p {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-2);
  }

  .sponsor-card a {
    color: var(--yen-cyan);
  }

  .sponsor-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: linear-gradient(110deg, var(--yen-cyan), var(--sl-color-accent));
    color: var(--sl-color-black) !important;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
</style>
